// Ch16 B10 "Swept away" (C, 1 min), B11 "Act break" (C, 1 min) and B12 "Act card" (C, 0.2 min).
// act2_ch16.md §2. After the storm-wakes set piece (the flow sets ch16_line_held on its scripted escape).
// S01: the storm here, swallowing the singers' heads. S02: Kerrid on the line at the dais's seaward edge;
// Rhen hears a man humming a current-song inside the storm (rule 7: nothing more) and doesn't freeze this
// time: he grabs Asha's hand. S03: the sea comes over the dais. Hard cuts, no slow-motion, no dialogue.
// B11: black, the sea; then the Prologue's vigil frame at Iskarra, deeper again, the burner lower (no fire,
// no circle). Rhen's VO, older, plain fact (the sheet's recommended line). B12: the act card. Act III stays
// paused (ADR 0203/0205): Act II's playable content ends here.
title: ch16_swept_away
location: ch16/drowned_choir
---
@letterbox on
@camera S01
@music abiding_guard fade=0.0
@sfx undertow_wall_roar
@wait 3.0
@camera S02
@anim kerrid hold_line
@sfx current_song at=storm vol=0.3
@anim rhen grab_hand asha
@wait 2.5
@camera S03
@wait 1.5
@music silence fade=0.0
@fade out 0.5
@camera S04
@wait 3.0
@camera P04
@fade in 2.0
@music act2_break fade=2.0
@wait 3.0
Narrator(rhen) [tender]: Everybody I loved had a reason to stay where they were. That night, all of us stopped. #line:ch16_break_001 #vo
@wait 4.0
@fade out 3.0
@music silence fade=2.0
<<set $ch16_act_two_complete = true>>
@wait 1.5
Act III\: The Unbinding #line:ch16_act_card_001 #tn:"The act card between Act II and Act III. Title case, as a chapter heading."
@wait 2.0
@letterbox off
===
